      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DON'T CRY MAMA (1) jumps from box 1 for the first time after placing latest at Q Parklands (30.97) in a Mix 5. Solid record at the distance winning five races. Can find winning form. MAC DEUCE (8) showed blistering pace early and gave a sight when in the minors, beaten 3.5 lengths over 352m this track in 20.20. Will give a great sight again. TOUGH ENOUGH (7) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with three wins and a placing from eight tries. Was out of the placings last time (22.25) at this track in a Mix 5, finishing fourth and beaten 3 lengths. Suited here and expected to run well. STRIKES TWICE (2) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
